---

<section class="journey" id="journey">
  <div class="section-inner">
<div class="section-tag reveal">Simplified Client Journey</div>

    <h2 class="section-heading reveal">
      Discover → Develop → <em>Sustain</em>
    </h2>

    <p class="section-sub reveal">
      The client-facing journey keeps the pathway simple: understand the institution, develop the right capability and support sustained execution. The full institutional methodology remains available in the methodology section.
    </p>

    <div class="methodology-phases reveal">
      <div class="phase">
        <div class="phase-header">
          <div class="phase-number">01</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Discover</h3>
            <p>Clarify institutional priorities, operating realities and capability gaps before prescribing solutions.</p>
          </div>
            </div>
          </div>


          <div class="phase">
        <div class="phase-header">
          <div class="phase-number">02</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Develop</h3>
            <p>Translate evidence into learning, advisory and implementation pathways aligned to institutional needs.</p>
          </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        <div class="phase">
        <div class="phase-header">
          <div class="phase-number">03</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Sustain</h3>
            <p>Reinforce execution through performance visibility, monitoring and continuous improvement support.</p>
          </div>
            </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<style>
  .methodology-phases {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .phase {
    padding: 28px;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid rgba(201, 136, 42, 0.12);
    border-radius: 18px;
  }

 .phase-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .phase-number {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), #e7b14c);
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(201, 136, 42, 0.22);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .phase-header h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    color: var(--navy);
  }

  .phase-header p {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .methodology-phases {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }
}

.phase {
      padding: 24px;
    }
</style>
